X:1
T:Non, je ne regrette rien
C:Charles Dumont, 1956 (Edith Piaf)
N:Best-effort version. Melody is the flute line of an arrangement MIDI
N:(hamienet.com), moved up from G to C to fit the recorder range, with the
N:rhythm rounded to eighths. Chords are read from the arrangement's strings.
N:One pass is the whole song (24 bars); the last bar is a rest-out before
N:the first verse returns.
N:The accompaniment is a rolling arpeggio (%%MIDI gchord) instead of the default
N:boom-chick on every beat: bass on beat 1, then the chord's root, fifth and third on beats 2 to 4.
M:12/8
